>s</u><u>ha</u>bi alyameen<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Liashabi alyameeni"},{"sura":56,"aya":39,"key":"56:39","arabic":"ثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","english":"A multitude from the former [generations]","transliteration_html":"Thullatun mina alawwaleen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Thullatun mina alawwaleena"},{"sura":56,"aya":40,"key":"56:40","arabic":"وَثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِينَ","english":"and a multitude from the latter [ones].","transliteration_html":"Wathullatun mina al<u>a</u>khireen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Wathullatun mina alakhireena"},{"sura":56,"aya":41,"key":"56:41","arabic":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ مَآ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ","english":"And the People of the Left Hand—what are the People of the Left Hand?!","transliteration_html":"Waa<u>s</u><u>ha</u>bu a<b>l</b>shshim<u>a</u>li m<u>a</u> a<u>s</u><u>ha</u>bu a<b>l</b>shshim<u>a</u>l<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Waashabu alshshimali ma ashabu alshshimali"},{"sura":56,"aya":42,"key":"56:42","arabic":"فِى سَمُومٍۢ وَحَمِيمٍۢ","english":"Amid infernal miasma and boiling water","transliteration_html":"Fee samoomin wa<u>h</u>ameem<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Fee samoomin wahameemin"},{"sura":56,"aya":43,"key":"56:43","arabic":"وَظِلٍّۢ مِّن يَحْمُومٍۢ","english":"and the shadow of a dense black smoke,","transliteration_html":"Wa<i><u>th</u></i>illin min ya<u>h</u>moom<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Wathillin min yahmoomin"},{"sura":56,"aya":44,"key":"56:44","arabic":"لَّا بَارِدٍۢ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ","english":"neither cool nor beneficial.","transliteration_html":"L<u>a</u> b<u>a</u>ridin wal<u>a</u> kareem<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"La baridin wala kareemin"},{"sura":56,"aya":45,"key":"56:45","arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَبْلَ ذَٰلِكَ مُتْرَفِينَ","english":"Indeed they had been affluent before this,","transliteration_html":"Innahum k<u>a</u>noo qabla <u>tha</u>lika mutrafeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Innahum kanoo qabla thalika mutrafeena"},{"sura":56,"aya":46,"key":"56:46","arabic":"وَكَانُوا۟ يُصِرُّونَ عَلَى ٱلْحِنثِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","english":"and they used to persist in the great sin.","transliteration_html":"Wak<u>a</u>noo yu<u>s</u>irroona AAal<u>a</u> al<u>h</u>inthi alAAa<i><u>th</u></i>eem<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Wakanoo yusirroona AAala alhinthi alAAatheemi"},{"sura":56,"aya":47,"key":"56:47","arabic":"وَكَانُوا۟ يَقُولُونَ أَئِذَا مِتْنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابًۭا وَعِظَـٰمًا أَءِنَّا لَمَبْعُوثُونَ","english":"And they used to say, ‘What! When we are dead and become dust and bones, shall we be resurrected?!","transliteration_html":"Wak<u>a</u>noo yaqooloona ai<u>tha</u> mitn<u>a</u> wakunn<u>a</u> tur<u>a</u>ban waAAi<i><u>th</u></i><u>a</u>man ainn<u>a</u> lamabAAoothoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Wakanoo yaqooloona aitha mitna wakunna turaban waAAithaman ainna lamabAAoothoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":48,"key":"56:48","arabic":"أَوَءَابَآؤُنَا ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ","english":"And our forefathers too?!’","transliteration_html":"Awa <u>a</u>b<u>a</u>on<u>a</u> alawwaloon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Awa abaona alawwaloona"},{"sura":56,"aya":49,"key":"56:49","arabic":"قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ وَٱلْـَٔاخِرِينَ","english":"Say, ‘Indeed the former and latter generations","transliteration_html":"Qul inna alawwaleena wa<b>a</b>l<u>a</u>khireen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Qul inna alawwaleena waalakhireena"},{"sura":56,"aya":50,"key":"56:50","arabic":"لَمَجْمُوعُونَ إِلَىٰ مِيقَـٰتِ يَوْمٍۢ مَّعْلُومٍۢ","english":"will all be gathered for the tryst of a known day.","transliteration_html":"LamajmooAAoona il<u>a</u> meeq<u>a</u>ti yawmin maAAloom<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"LamajmooAAoona ila meeqati yawmin maAAloomin"},{"sura":56,"aya":51,"key":"56:51","arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّكُمْ أَيُّهَا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ ٱلْمُكَذِّبُونَ","english":"Then indeed, you, astray deniers,","transliteration_html":"Thumma innakum ayyuh<u>a</u> a<b>l</b><u>dda</u>lloona almuka<u>thth</u>iboon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Thumma innakum ayyuha alddalloona almukaththiboona"},{"sura":56,"aya":52,"key":"56:52","arabic":"لَـَٔاكِلُونَ مِن شَجَرٍۢ مِّن زَقُّومٍۢ","english":"will surely eat from the Zaqqum tree","transliteration_html":"La<u>a</u>kiloona min shajarin min zaqqoom<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Laakiloona min shajarin min zaqqoomin"},{"sura":56,"aya":53,"key":"56:53","arabic":"فَمَالِـُٔونَ مِنْهَا ٱلْبُطُونَ","english":"and stuff your bellies with it,","transliteration_html":"Fam<u>a</u>lioona minh<u>a</u> albu<u>t</u>oon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Famalioona minha albutoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":54,"key":"56:54","arabic":"فَشَـٰرِبُونَ عَلَيْهِ مِنَ ٱلْحَمِيمِ","english":"and drink boiling water on top of it,","transliteration_html":"Fash<u>a</u>riboona AAalayhi mina al<u>h</u>ameem<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fashariboona AAalayhi mina alhameemi"},{"sura":56,"aya":55,"key":"56:55","arabic":"فَشَـٰرِبُونَ شُرْبَ ٱلْهِيمِ","english":"drinking like thirsty camels.’","transliteration_html":"Fash<u>a</u>riboona shurba alheem<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fashariboona shurba alheemi"},{"sura":56,"aya":56,"key":"56:56","arabic":"هَـٰذَا نُزُلُهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ","english":"Such will be the hospitality they receive on the Day of Retribution.","transliteration_html":"H<u>atha</u> nuzuluhum yawma a<b>l</b>ddeen<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Hatha nuzuluhum yawma alddeeni"},{"sura":56,"aya":57,"key":"56:57","arabic":"نَحْنُ خَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ فَلَوْلَا تُصَدِّقُونَ","english":"We created you. Then why do you not acknowledge it?","transliteration_html":"Na<u>h</u>nu khalaqn<u>a</u>kum falawl<u>a</u> tu<u>s</u>addiqoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Nahnu khalaqnakum falawla tusaddiqoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":58,"key":"56:58","arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا تُمْنُونَ","english":"Have you considered the sperm that you emit?","transliteration_html":"Afaraaytum m<u>a</u> tumnoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Afaraaytum ma tumnoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":59,"key":"56:59","arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ تَخْلُقُونَهُۥٓ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْخَـٰلِقُونَ","english":"Is it you who create it, or are We the creator?","transliteration_html":"Aantum takhluqoonahu am na<u>h</u>nu alkh<u>a</u>liqoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Aantum takhluqoonahu am nahnu alkhaliqoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":60,"key":"56:60","arabic":"نَحْنُ قَدَّرْنَا بَيْنَكُمُ ٱلْمَوْتَ وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمَسْبُوقِينَ","english":"We have ordained death among you, and We are not to be outmaneuvered","transliteration_html":"Na<u>h</u>nu qaddarn<u>a</u> baynakumu almawta wam<u>a</u> na<u>h</u>nu bimasbooqeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Nahnu qaddarna baynakumu almawta wama nahnu bimasbooqeena"},{"sura":56,"aya":61,"key":"56:61","arabic":"عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّبَدِّلَ أَمْثَـٰلَكُمْ وَنُنشِئَكُمْ فِى مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","english":"from replacing you with your likes and recreating you in [a realm] you do not know.","transliteration_html":"AAal<u>a</u> an nubaddila amth<u>a</u>lakum wanunshiakum fee m<u>a</u> l<u>a</u> taAAlamoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"AAala an nubaddila amthalakum wanunshiakum fee ma la taAAlamoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":62,"key":"56:62","arabic":"وَلَقَدْ عَلِمْتُمُ ٱلنَّشْأَةَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ فَلَوْلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","english":"Certainly you have known the first genesis, then why do you not take admonition?","transliteration_html":"Walaqad AAalimtumu a<b>l</b>nnashata alool<u>a</u> falawl<u>a</u> ta<u>th</u>akkaroon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Walaqad AAalimtumu alnnashata aloola falawla tathakkaroona"},{"sura":56,"aya":63,"key":"56:63","arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا تَحْرُثُونَ","english":"Have you considered what you sow?","transliteration_html":"Afaraaytum m<u>a</u> ta<u>h</u>ruthoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Afaraaytum ma tahruthoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":64,"key":"56:64","arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ تَزْرَعُونَهُۥٓ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلزَّٰرِعُونَ","english":"Is it you who make it grow, or are We the grower?","transliteration_html":"Aantum tazraAAoonahu am na<u>h</u>nu a<b>l</b>zz<u>a</u>riAAoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Aantum tazraAAoonahu am nahnu alzzariAAoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":65,"key":"56:65","arabic":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ لَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ حُطَـٰمًۭا فَظَلْتُمْ تَفَكَّهُونَ","english":"If We wish, We turn it into chaff, whereat you are left stunned [saying to yourselves,]","transliteration_html":"Law nash<u>a</u>o lajaAAaln<u>a</u>hu <u>h</u>u<u>ta</u>man fa<i><u>th</u></i>altum tafakkahoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Law nashao lajaAAalnahu hutaman fathaltum tafakkahoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":66,"key":"56:66","arabic":"إِنَّا لَمُغْرَمُونَ","english":"‘Indeed we have suffered loss!","transliteration_html":"Inn<u>a</u> lamughramoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Inna lamughramoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":67,"key":"56:67","arabic":"بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ","english":"No, we are deprived!’","transliteration_html":"Bal na<u>h</u>nu ma<u>h</u>roomoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Bal nahnu mahroomoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":68,"key":"56:68","arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلْمَآءَ ٱلَّذِى تَشْرَبُونَ","english":"Have you considered the water that you drink?","transliteration_html":"Afaraaytumu alm<u>a</u>a alla<u>th</u>ee tashraboon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Afaraaytumu almaa allathee tashraboona"},{"sura":56,"aya":69,"key":"56:69","arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنزَلْتُمُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْمُزْنِ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنزِلُونَ","english":"Is it you who bring it down from the rain cloud, or is it We who bring [it] down?","transliteration_html":"Aantum anzaltumoohu mina almuzni am na<u>h</u>nu almunziloon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Aantum anzaltumoohu mina almuzni am nahnu almunziloona"},{"sura":56,"aya":70,"key":"56:70","arabic":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ جَعَلْنَـٰهُ أُجَاجًۭا فَلَوْلَا تَشْكُرُونَ","english":"If We wish We can make it bitter. Then why do you not give thanks?","transliteration_html":"Law nash<u>a</u>o jaAAaln<u>a</u>hu oj<u>a</u>jan falawl<u>a</u> tashkuroon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Law nashao jaAAalnahu ojajan falawla tashkuroona"},{"sura":56,"aya":71,"key":"56:71","arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ٱلَّتِى تُورُونَ","english":"Have you considered the fire that you kindle?","transliteration_html":"Afaraaytumu a<b>l</b>nn<u>a</u>ra allatee tooroon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Afaraaytumu alnnara allatee tooroona"},{"sura":56,"aya":72,"key":"56:72","arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنشَأْتُمْ شَجَرَتَهَآ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنشِـُٔونَ","english":"Was it you who caused its tree to grow, or were We the grower?","transliteration_html":"Aantum anshatum shajaratah<u>a</u> am na<u>h</u>nu almunshioon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Aantum anshatum shajarataha am nahnu almunshioona"},{"sura":56,"aya":73,"key":"56:73","arabic":"نَحْنُ جَعَلْنَـٰهَا تَذْكِرَةًۭ وَمَتَـٰعًۭا لِّلْمُقْوِينَ","english":"It was We who made it a reminder and a boon for the desert-dwellers.","transliteration_html":"Na<u>h</u>nu jaAAaln<u>a</u>h<u>a</u> ta<u>th</u>kiratan wamat<u>a</u>AAan lilmuqween<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Nahnu jaAAalnaha tathkiratan wamataAAan lilmuqweena"},{"sura":56,"aya":74,"key":"56:74","arabic":"فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","english":"So celebrate the Name of your Lord, the All-supreme.","transliteration_html":"Fasabbi<u>h</u> bi<b>i</b>smi rabbika alAAa<i><u>th</u></i>eem<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi"},{"sura":56,"aya":75,"key":"56:75","arabic":"۞ فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَوَٰقِعِ ٱلنُّجُومِ","english":"I swear by the places where the stars set!","transliteration_html":"Fal<u>a</u> oqsimu bimaw<u>a</u>qiAAi a<b>l</b>nnujoom<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fala oqsimu bimawaqiAAi alnnujoomi"},{"sura":56,"aya":76,"key":"56:76","arabic":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَقَسَمٌۭ لَّوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","english":"And indeed it is a great oath, should you know.","transliteration_html":"Wainnahu laqasamun law taAAlamoona AAa<i><u>th</u></i>eem<b>un</b>","transliteration_text":"Wainnahu laqasamun law taAAlamoona AAatheemun"},{"sura":56,"aya":77,"key":"56:77","arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقُرْءَانٌۭ كَرِيمٌۭ","english":"This is indeed a noble Quran,","transliteration_html":"Innahu laqur<u>a</u>nun kareem<b>un</b>","transliteration_text":"Innahu laquranun kareemun"},{"sura":56,"aya":78,"key":"56:78","arabic":"فِى كِتَـٰبٍۢ مَّكْنُونٍۢ","english":"in a guarded Book","transliteration_html":"Fee kit<u>a</u>bin maknoon<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Fee kitabin maknoonin"},{"sura":56,"aya":79,"key":"56:79","arabic":"لَّا يَمَسُّهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْمُطَهَّرُونَ","english":"—no one touches it except the pure ones—","transliteration_html":"L<u>a</u> yamassuhu ill<u>a</u> almu<u>t</u>ahharoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"La yamassuhu illa almutahharoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":80,"key":"56:80","arabic":"تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","english":"sent down gradually from the Lord of all the worlds.","transliteration_html":"Tanzeelun min rabbi alAA<u>a</u>lameen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Tanzeelun min rabbi alAAalameena"},{"sura":56,"aya":81,"key":"56:81","arabic":"أَفَبِهَـٰذَا ٱلْحَدِيثِ أَنتُم مُّدْهِنُونَ","english":"What! Do you take lightly this discourse?","transliteration_html":"Afabih<u>atha</u> al<u>h</u>adeethi antum mudhinoon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Afabihatha alhadeethi antum mudhinoona"},{"sura":56,"aya":82,"key":"56:82","arabic":"وَتَجْعَلُونَ رِزْقَكُمْ أَنَّكُمْ تُكَذِّبُونَ","english":"And make your denial of it your vocation?","transliteration_html":"WatajAAaloona rizqakum annakum tuka<u>thth</u>iboon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"WatajAAaloona rizqakum annakum tukaththiboona"},{"sura":56,"aya":83,"key":"56:83","arabic":"فَلَوْلَآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلْحُلْقُومَ","english":"So when it reaches the throat [of the dying person],","transliteration_html":"Falawl<u>a</u> i<u>tha</u> balaghati al<u>h</u>ulqoom<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Falawla itha balaghati alhulqooma"},{"sura":56,"aya":84,"key":"56:84","arabic":"وَأَنتُمْ حِينَئِذٍۢ تَنظُرُونَ","english":"and at that moment you are looking on [at his bedside]","transliteration_html":"Waantum <u>h</u>eenai<u>th</u>in tan<i><u>th</u></i>uroona","transliteration_text":"Waantum heenaithin tanthuroona"},{"sura":56,"aya":85,"key":"56:85","arabic":"وَنَحْنُ أَقْرَبُ إِلَيْهِ مِنكُمْ وَلَـٰكِن لَّا تُبْصِرُونَ","english":"—and We are nearer to him than you are, though you do not perceive—","transliteration_html":"Wana<u>h</u>nu aqrabu ilayhi minkum wal<u>a</u>kin l<u>a</u> tub<u>s</u>iroon<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Wanahnu aqrabu ilayhi minkum walakin la tubsiroona"},{"sura":56,"aya":86,"key":"56:86","arabic":"فَلَوْلَآ إِن كُنتُمْ غَيْرَ مَدِينِينَ","english":"then why do you not restore it, if you are not subject","transliteration_html":"Falawl<u>a</u> in kuntum ghayra madeeneen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Falawla in kuntum ghayra madeeneena"},{"sura":56,"aya":87,"key":"56:87","arabic":"تَرْجِعُونَهَآ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","english":"[to Divine dispensation], if you are truthful?","transliteration_html":"TarjiAAoonah<u>a</u> in kuntum <u>sa</u>diqeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"TarjiAAoonaha in kuntum sadiqeena"},{"sura":56,"aya":88,"key":"56:88","arabic":"فَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ","english":"Then, if he be of those brought near,","transliteration_html":"Faamm<u>a</u> in k<u>a</u>na mina almuqarrabeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Faamma in kana mina almuqarrabeena"},{"sura":56,"aya":89,"key":"56:89","arabic":"فَرَوْحٌۭ وَرَيْحَانٌۭ وَجَنَّتُ نَعِيمٍۢ","english":"then ease, abundance, and a garden of bliss.","transliteration_html":"Faraw<u>h</u>un waray<u>ha</u>nun wajannatu naAAeem<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Farawhun warayhanun wajannatu naAAeemin"},{"sura":56,"aya":90,"key":"56:90","arabic":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنْ أَصْحَـٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ","english":"And if he be of the People of the Right Hand,","transliteration_html":"Waamm<u>a</u> in k<u>a</u>na min a<u>s</u><u>ha</u>bi alyameen<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Waamma in kana min ashabi alyameeni"},{"sura":56,"aya":91,"key":"56:91","arabic":"فَسَلَـٰمٌۭ لَّكَ مِنْ أَصْحَـٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ","english":"then [he will be told,] ‘Peace be on you, from the People of the Right Hand!’","transliteration_html":"Fasal<u>a</u>mun laka min a<u>s</u><u>ha</u>bi alyameen<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fasalamun laka min ashabi alyameeni"},{"sura":56,"aya":92,"key":"56:92","arabic":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","english":"But if he be of the impugners, the astray ones,","transliteration_html":"Waamm<u>a</u> in k<u>a</u>na mina almuka<u>thth</u>ibeena a<b>l</b><u>dda</u>lleen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Waamma in kana mina almukaththibeena alddalleena"},{"sura":56,"aya":93,"key":"56:93","arabic":"فَنُزُلٌۭ مِّنْ حَمِيمٍۢ","english":"then a treat of boiling water","transliteration_html":"Fanuzulun min <u>h</u>ameem<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Fanuzulun min hameemin"},{"sura":56,"aya":94,"key":"56:94","arabic":"وَتَصْلِيَةُ جَحِيمٍ","english":"and entry into hell.","transliteration_html":"Wata<u>s</u>liyatu ja<u>h</u>eem<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Watasliyatu jaheemin"},{"sura":56,"aya":95,"key":"56:95","arabic":"إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَهُوَ حَقُّ ٱلْيَقِينِ","english":"Indeed this is certain truth.","transliteration_html":"Inna h<u>atha</u> lahuwa <u>h</u>aqqu alyaqeen<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Inna hatha lahuwa haqqu alyaqeeni"},{"sura":56,"aya":96,"key":"56:96","arabic":"فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","english":"So celebrate the Name of your Lord, the All-supreme!","transliteration_html":"Fasabbi<u>h</u> bi<b>i</b>smi rabbika alAAa<i><u>th</u></i>eem<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi"}]}